# Blood and Glory (windurst 87): the offer without the pole, and the level edge's met side. A level-71 WAR (the Pole of
# Trials' level) at Staff 2300: 445 (oncePerZone); its finish with a full bag (no pole: giveItem false, not begun); a
# second talk in the zone falls to the Golem's 343 (oncePerZone: priority Ignore); after a rezone 445 again, begun (the
# pole, 0 weapon skill points, and the Weapon Training Guide).
lists WindurstWalls/Shantotto/onTrigger WindurstWalls/onEventFinish/445
char zone=WindurstWalls pos=122.6,-3.0,111.6 job=WAR lvl=71
quest Windurst.CursesFoiledAgain1 completed
quest Windurst.CursesFoiledAgain2 completed
quest Windurst.CursesFoiledAGolem completed
skill Staff 2300
login
trigger Shantotto                                   # level 71, Staff 2300, no guide: event 445 (oncePerZone)
fill-inventory
finish                                              # no pole, the bag full: giveItem false, not begun
free-inventory
trigger Shantotto                                   # 445 played this zone: the Golem's 343
finish
rezone
trigger Shantotto                                   # after the rezone: 445 again
finish                                              # the Pole of Trials and the Weapon Training Guide: begun
